  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_01",
  "title": "缄默不言",
  "storyCode": "TW-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c0cb0ca56a275e33611622d5114a69f5ec342010a3f2bf7a631b13f03359fc16",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:10 P.M.    天气/晴\n莱塔尼亚移动城镇沃伦姆德，这座昔日繁华的商业都市如今人迹罕见"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "城镇议事厅"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林·霍索恩长官，你刚才去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "决策会的时候你不在场，让我们怎么做决定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那在你们决定我儿子命运的时候，我在场吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......那件事，塔佳娜应该已经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，告诉我了。让塔佳娜来告诉我的。我只是提醒你们一下你们所做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......感染者们仍旧在抗议，他们甚至开始排斥新加入社区的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们想要什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们......他们认为那场火灾是有人“别有用心”安排的，他们要为安托医生和死去的感染者求个说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别有用心，求个说法，很好，有人在煽动他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是感染者，他们中的大部分也曾是沃伦姆德的居民，他们不会做出这么低劣的栽赃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们有和那些武装可疑分子接触吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......暂时没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，但是那些可疑分子一直在村庄周围徘徊，我担心他们会影响到那些抗议者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，是岗哨的联络——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......两个人？是感染者吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自称罗德岛？我记得这个名字——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是安托医生所属的公司，唉，该来的迟早要来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托医生是一位值得尊敬的感染者。他们也许是来调查安托医生的踪迹的，他们有权利知道真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放他们进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你也听到了，按长官说的做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，可是这样真的没问题吗？如果他们和那些武装人员有关的话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大裂谷，火灾，感染者。我们还有疑神疑鬼的余裕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他们知道所有事情后会怎么样？罗德岛如果向我们索赔追责，只会让沃伦姆德雪上加霜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他们拒之门外？还是欺骗他们？告诉他们安托医生带着矿石病患者们远足去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道瞒不住，但这件事也不是你说了算的，不怕一万就怕万一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真相不被任何人决定，不过......算了，随你们吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走？你又要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......去解决问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只负责保证这座城镇回到正轨，决策过程嘛......你们过家家，我不感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你现在很难过，我也知道我们做了很多不太好的事情，但这没办法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道没办法，这就是我现在还在心平气和地同你说话的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛的事情交给你们了，你们比较擅长这种事。我去看看其他街道的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林！塞弗林·霍索恩！你现在才是这里的长官，不要随便乱跑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧——他这个人总是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，都是可怜人。塔佳娜，塞弗林，托尔，都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶紧把这里收拾一下，罗德岛的人马上就要到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃伦姆德，意为第八个月亮，与周围的七座城镇共同组合成了莱塔尼亚北部璀璨的商业聚落——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "书上是这么写的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过眼前的景象和“商业聚落”根本搭不上边啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因为“大裂谷”的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。那样规模的天灾并不常见，活性源石裸露在岩壁上，深度也许有上千米，唔啊，回想起来真是触目惊心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是亚叶姐姐......你当时明明在好奇扔一发炮弹下去会怎么样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，那是对于活性源石的研究精神，说真的，搞不好真能把整片高地一分为二？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我们是勉强绕路抵达了，但这座城镇估计现在寸步难行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种时候还会有游客？好奇怪的装束，不会是什么危险分子吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看那个尾巴，啊，还有她肩膀上的结晶，是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是那个装束，我好像在哪里见到过......是......吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......亚、亚叶姐姐，就这么坦荡荡地走在街上真的没关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莱塔尼亚的源石技艺普及带来了两点明显有别于他处的特色，音乐艺术的繁荣，以及，对感染者的宽容态度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然会被限制人身自由，但至少当你想要活下去的时候，你可以付出代价赢回生活的权利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......代价？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少是付得起的代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算远离了中心，也有冲突和纠纷，但沃伦姆德依旧提供了感染者居住的街道......至少她是这么和我说的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——啊，有人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唔？那个叔叔的装束......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是沃伦姆德的宪兵？不如去问问路？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他朝我们走过来了诶，是来迎接我们的吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不清楚......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啊，他点了一支烟。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他把打火机揣进兜里了，他换了个手拿烟，他又换了一次手——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（——他头也不回地走掉了！亚叶姐姐！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，我们是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，罗德岛的人，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "政府议事厅就在前面，最高的那座塔下面。看见了吗，好。会有人在那里接待你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，谢谢，可请问您是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？我下班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我下班了，而我现在不想在公务之外有太多交谈......我还有急事处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这样，回头见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他就这么走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然有点不讲礼貌，不过那个叔叔看起来有什么心事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......可是我们也很累啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过好歹给我们指了路，我们还是先去问问本地的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官！您在这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者们又开始抗议了，其他宪兵都已经过去了，但是现场需要您的指挥——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！您又在抽烟了！是店长们又对您说了什么对不对？请保持形象，否则怎么让居民们信服——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嗯？您怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......说是，长官来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了吗，长官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么。你一直很敬业，塔佳娜。我很欣赏你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？谢谢夸奖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那边两位，看装束不是本地人吧？难道是罗德岛的医生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？啊，正是。我们是罗德岛的医生。请叫我亚叶，这位是铃兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（医生？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（要说是医生......也算是吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我也算吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我是医疗部门的正式干员。小丽萨你......跟着凯尔希医生学习所以算个见习医生，大概。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此......啊！二位是在去议事厅的路上对吧？是我擅自拦下了各位，抱歉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然理应由长官接待二位，但是十二音街道的确需要长官的帮忙......这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，其实他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳！好了，塔佳娜，你给她们带路，我先去看看感染者们的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道你们的目的，不过现在情况紧急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们知道现在沃伦姆德的情况吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大裂谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，和聪明人说话可以略去很多不必要的交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以现在感染者居民们的反抗情绪空前强烈，如果不希望卷进来，就不要靠近十二音街道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是感染者问题的对策专家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，贵司的安托医生曾和我们有过密切的合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你应该知道，我们可以帮上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未必需要。我们不该让客人立刻卷入麻烦，这也会给我们带来麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那么，安托在这里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她现在不在镇上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不好了！打起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那些感染者有武器！怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们用、用刀！？会出人命吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者问题对策专家，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
